error: 'merge' cannot be dispatched on a 'Fold' value: its signature names a type that no set value has
  --> examples/diagnostics/2039-diagnostics-open-set-dispatch.sx:37:35
   |
37 |     merge :: (self: *Self, other: Self) -> i64;
   |                                   ^^^^

help: 'Self' in a required method denotes the MEMBER, and a set value is not any one member — call it through a membership bound instead: 'f :: (v: $V/Fold) { v.merge(…); }'
   |
37 |     merge :: (self: *Self, other: Self) -> i64;
   |                                   ^^^^

